WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:04.960
With all the sequels, reboots, spin-offs,
and occasional original films that get released

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.679
every month, it can be hard to keep track
of what's actually getting released.

00:00:08.679 --> 00:00:12.219
Luckily, we've combed through every notable
movie release that's coming down the pipeline

00:00:12.219 --> 00:00:15.089
this Fall so you won't have to worry about
missing anything.

00:00:15.089 --> 00:00:18.770
Here are some of the future blockbusters we're
projecting will hit it big in the Fall, in

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:22.250
order of their expected release date.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.250
Mandy

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.930
It seems like Nicolas Cage's entire career
was leading to Mandy.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:31.140
The story follows a mountain man named Red
whose girlfriend, Mandy, is kidnapped, leading

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.539
him to embark on a brutal odyssey of revenge
against the cult leader responsible.

00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:39.409
Pretty much everyone who's seen Mandy has
walked away praising both Cage's performance

00:00:39.409 --> 00:00:44.039
and director Panos Cosmatos' dedication to
making a truly insane film.

00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:47.790
The movie drops into theaters September 14th,
so keep your schedule clear if you want to

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:52.020
see Nicholas Cage act insane in a way only
he can.

00:00:58.969 --> 00:00:59.960
The Predator

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:04.680
Kicking off a new round of interplanetary
big game hunting, The Predator finds writer-director

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:08.070
Shane Black making a long-overdue return to
the franchise.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.490
According to actor Thomas Jane, the plot will
involve a group of PTSD-stricken soldiers

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.659
who band together to kill the spine-cracking
alien hunters.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:20.360
The movie's got an incredible cast, featuring
Olivia Munn, Trevante Rhodes, Keegan-Michael

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.290
Key, Sterling K. Brown, and Edward James Olmos.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:27.280
We can expect our ragtag heroes to face off
against everyone's favorite skull collector

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.800
on September 14th.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.670
Operation Finale

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:39.289
Directed by Chris Weitz, Operation Finale
tells the true story of an elite Israeli spy

00:01:39.289 --> 00:01:44.240
unit tasked with capturing a high-profile
Nazi who escaped to Argentina after the war.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.070
With Oscar Isaac starring as the leader of
the unit and Ben Kingsley as the fugitive

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:51.930
nazi, there's sure to be some incredible acting
in this historical drama.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:56.170
The film hits theaters on September 14th,
and if you're at all interested in history,

00:01:56.170 --> 00:02:02.049
espionage, or real-life revenge stories, then
Operation Finale might be right up your alley.

00:02:02.049 --> 00:02:04.189
The House with a Clock in its Walls

00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:08.340
Eli Roth isn't really known for his kid-friendly
films, but he's looking to change things up

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.340
with The House with a Clock in its Walls.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.640
Based on the classic children's book by John
Bellairs, this Gothic fright flick tells the

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:18.440
story of a 10-year-old boy who's sent to live
in a quiet Michigan town with an uncle, played

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.160
by Jack Black, who turns out to be a warlock.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.220
The House with a Clock in its Walls also stars
Cate Blanchett and Kyle Maclachlan, and it's

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.630
set to scare kids on September 21st.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.300
The Old Man and the Gun

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.720
While his films don't usually get a lot of
attention from mainstream audiences, director

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:40.409
David Lowery has been on a low-key roll since
2013, with movies like Ain't Them Bodies Saints,

00:02:40.409 --> 00:02:42.340
Pete's Dragon, and A Ghost Story.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:46.540
Now, Lowery is re-teaming with Robert Redford
for The Old Man and the Gun, the amazing true

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:51.280
story of Forrest Tucker, a 71-year-old crook
who escaped from prison and went on a bank

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.130
robbing spree around the country.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:57.180
Sissy Spacek plays his love interest, and
Casey Affleck stars as the cop determined

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.180
to bring him down.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.980
The Old Man and the Gun will arrive on September
28th, which gives you plenty of time to visit

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:06.690
your own elderly relatives and hear about
their wild lives first.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:07.909
Venom

00:03:07.909 --> 00:03:12.080
Everyone's favorite spider-themed anti-hero,
Venom, is finally going to star in a major

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.080
motion picture.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.800
The alien symbiote is now slated to sling
his way into theaters on October 5th, 2018,

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.010
with Tom Hardy in the title role.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:24.410
Hardy's not the only acting powerhouse to
appear in the film; Venom also stars Riz Ahmed,

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.080
Michelle Williams, and Jenny Slate.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.730
With this much talent involved, Venom is at
least guaranteed to be more watchable than

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.040
the last time he appeared on screen.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.400
Bad Times at the El Royale

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:46.079
Sometimes all a movie needs to do is pack
in enough talented actors for it to be incredible,

00:03:46.079 --> 00:03:50.160
and Bad Times at the El Royale definitely
looks like a sleazy good time with some talented

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.160
actors.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:55.379
Jeff Bridges, Chris Hemsworth, Dakota Johnson,
and Jon Hamm star in the noir-ish movie written

00:03:55.379 --> 00:03:59.430
and directed by Drew Goddard, best known for
helming Cabin in the Woods.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:03.790
While plot details are scarce, we know the
story is set in the '60s and involves a bunch

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:06.519
of crooks who wind up at a Lake Tahoe hotel.

00:04:06.519 --> 00:04:11.000
There's a bank robbery, a cult leader, and
a mysterious organization spying on the hotel

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.000
guests.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.170
Regardless, we're pretty excited to watch
these unsavory characters go head-to-head

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.840
on October 5th.

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:21.530
First Man

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:26.080
After the smashing success of La La Land,
Ryan Gosling and Damien Chazelle will be joining

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.080
forces again for First Man.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.560
Instead of singing "City of Stars," Gosling
will be shooting for the moon.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:35.190
First Man will tell the story of the Space
Race, with Gosling playing Neil Armstrong,

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.419
the first man to walk on the moon in 1969.

00:04:38.419 --> 00:04:42.900
Along with Gosling, Corey Stoll plays astronaut
Buzz Aldrin, Lukas Haas plays astronaut Mike

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:47.810
Collins, and the cast will be rounded out
by Kyle Chandler, Claire Foy, Pablo Schreiber,

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.840
and Jon Bernthal.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:52.960
The film is in incredibly capable hands, so
we can't wait for First Man to finally launch

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:53.960
on October 12th.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.169
T-minus several months and counting…

00:04:55.169 --> 00:04:56.169
Serenity

00:04:56.169 --> 00:05:01.139
Written and directed by Steven Knight, Serenity
promises to be anything but serene.

00:05:01.139 --> 00:05:05.040
The film follows a fishing boat captain played
by Matthew McConaughey who gets lured into

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.449
a murderous scheme by a femme fatale, played
by Anne Hathaway.

00:05:08.449 --> 00:05:12.000
She's sick and tired of being abused by her
wealthy husband, so she wants McConaughey

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.780
to turn the guy into shark food.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:19.280
Of course, in film noir, nothing is ever as
it seems, and you can't trust anyone … even

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.660
Anne Hathaway.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:25.190
Serenity sails into theaters on October 19,
and judging by the trailer, this shark-infested

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.360
thriller promises to have quite a bite.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.380
"You're gonna need a bigger boat."

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.819
The Sisters Brothers

00:05:31.819 --> 00:05:35.810
Based on the acclaimed novel by Patrick deWitt,
the story follows a pair of brothers whose

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.390
last name is Sisters.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.229
The Sisters brothers make their living killing
people, and they're sent to hunt down a chemist

00:05:41.229 --> 00:05:44.190
who's stolen a formula that reveals the location
of gold.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.680
The gunslinging siblings are played by Joaquin
Phoenix and John C. Reilly, Riz Ahmed plays

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.060
their prey, and Jake Gyllenhaal stars as a
miner caught in the middle.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.720
Plus, there's Rutger Hauer and Carol Kane
rounding out the star-studded cast.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:59.349
The Sisters Brothers promises to ride into
theaters this fall, and we can't wait to see

00:05:59.349 --> 00:06:01.289
these actors fight it out in the Old West.

00:06:01.289 --> 00:06:04.130
"Have you ever had to be in a fight?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.340
I've been in a ton of fights.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:10.310
That's why I figured out how to stay the heck
out of a fight."

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:12.300
The Nutcracker and the Four Realms

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.480
Disney is releasing their next live-action
fantasy just in time for Thanksgiving.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:20.630
The Nutcracker and the Four Realms is set
to dance into cinemas on November 2nd, complete

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:24.639
with gorgeous sets, elaborate costumes, and
quite a few familiar faces.

00:06:24.639 --> 00:06:29.330
Inspired by E.T.A. Hoffman's story, the plot
follows a young girl named Clara who winds

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:34.610
up in a strange world of talking nutcrackers,
intimidating toy soldiers, and scary rodents.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.539
Along the way, she'll encounter a sugar plum
fairy that looks like Keira Knightley, a mysterious

00:06:38.539 --> 00:06:42.690
old man who resembles Morgan Freeman, and
a villainous dictator who shares a certain

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.660
similarity to Helen Mirren.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:48.580
Based on the trailers, we can expect the adaptation
of this beloved legend to dance in a dark

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.270
direction.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.009
Bohemian Rhapsody

00:06:52.009 --> 00:06:56.289
With his flawless voice and sexy swagger,
Freddie Mercury is one of the greatest rock

00:06:56.289 --> 00:06:57.780
stars in music history.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:02.130
A bio-pic has been in the works since 2010,
but the film hit multiple roadblocks along

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.009
the way.

00:07:05.009 --> 00:07:11.100
Finally, Bohemian Rhapsody is set for a 2018
release date, with Rami Malek of Mr. Robot

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.610
playing the Queen frontman.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:16.520
In addition to Malek's own voice, the film
will capture Mercury's unique vocal range

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.169
with the help of singer Marc Martel and sound
bites from Mercury himself.

00:07:20.169 --> 00:07:24.040
It's taken eight long years for Bohemian Rhapsody
to get here, and when the film hits theaters

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.480
on November 2nd, it promises it will rock
you.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.500
Robin Hood

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:40.260
Taron Egerton stars as Robin Hood, finally
bringing the outlaw archer back to the silver

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.840
screen for the first time in almost a decade.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:46.540
However, this version won't be quite as merry
as the ones we've seen before.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.860
"Lend me your ears!"

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.580
"...that's disgusting."

00:07:55.060 --> 00:08:00.460
2018's Robin Hood is going to be like a medieval
version of Batman Begins, showing us how Robin

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:03.270
of Locksley became Great Britain's most famous
bandit.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:07.449
Taking Robin Hood in a dark direction is certainly
an interesting choice, and with the winning

00:08:07.449 --> 00:08:12.389
combo of Egerton and Jamie Foxx as his partner,
the upcoming action flick could be one of

00:08:12.389 --> 00:08:15.050
2018's most exciting movies.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.360
Robin Hood will be stealing its way into theaters
on November 21st.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.360
Rich Moore and Phil Johnston, who wrote the
original script for Wreck-It Ralph, will share

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.360
directing duties, so it's bound to be a faithful
follow up to the original.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.360
You'll get a chance to see if Wreck-It Ralph
2 is even better than the first one when it

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.360
arrives on November 21st.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.360
Welcome to Marwen

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:25.860
Inspired by the 2010 documentary Marwencol,
director Robert Zemeckis will tell the story

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:30.380
of Mark Hogencamp, a crossdresser who was
brutally assaulted by a group of thugs.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:34.850
Suffering from brain damage and PTSD, he coped
with his attack by constructing a miniature

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.480
World War II village in his backyard.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:41.640
Welcome to Marwen stars Steve Carell in the
lead role, Gwendoline Christie as Hogencamp's

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:46.900
caretaker and Diane Kruger as a Belgian witch,
one of Hogencamp's characters come to life.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:51.090
The film also features Leslie Mann and Janelle
Monae, and it's scheduled to arrive in theaters

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.390
on November 21st.

